  "description": "ROOF_MASTER_PLAN RF-1 step 1 fixture (2026-10-11). Two 3x3 rooms of 2-storey concrete block rings, each with a door on its south side and its own lamp inside: room A (interior gu 5..9 x 4..8) under a CONCRETE roof with a 3x3 GLASS SKYLIGHT in its centre (gu 6..8 x 5..7; R-D5: the glass in the roof's lower layer, the upper layer empty), room B (interior gu 15..17 x 6..8) under a CONCRETE roof (the stages after glass; since 2026-10-14 only its two back walls x 14 / y 5 stand and its roof is 4x4, gu 15..18 x 6..9, so a blast's hole above and the rubble below are both in view: take `roof_blast`). A larger lamp outside stands for the hall / outdoor light above the roofs (R-D1). The agent starts outside, south of the rooms, so the roofs stay drawn. Dev fixture, not a level. The agent starts INSIDE room A (the reveal opens its roof) so the floor's light under the skylight can be judged. Since 2026-10-14 room A follows room B's model: its front walls (x 10, y 9) are gone, its roof is 6x6 (gu 5..10 x 4..9) with a 4x4 skylight (gu 6..9 x 5..8)."
 },
